OL,3,ARobert Pattinson says being cast as new
OL,4,AJames Bond is 'honour of a lifetime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Pattinson has been named as the
OL,7,Fnew James Bond - watch as London's
OL,8,FPiccadilly Circus shares the news
OL,10,FIn a statement, the 40-year-old British
OL,11,Factor says "to be entrusted with 007 is
OL,12,Fthe honour of a lifetime"
OL,14,FPattinson's career spans two decades -
OL,15,Fperhaps best known for playing vampire
OL,16,FEdward Cullen in the Twilight films, he
OL,17,Fhas also starred in Harry Potter and,
OL,18,Fmore recently, Christopher Nolan's The
OL,19,FOdyssey
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
