OL,3,ARobert Pattinson says being cast as new
OL,4,AJames Bond is 'honour of a lifetime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeaky Blinders creator Steven Knight
OL,7,Fhas been writing the script for the
OL,8,Fnext film, with Dune's Denis Villeneuve
OL,9,Fto direct - what we do, and don't, know
OL,10,Fabout the film
OL,12,FWho else was in the race to play Bond?
OL,13,FSee our list
OL,15,FThanking those who auditioned,
OL,16,FVilleneuve says "we were surrounded by
OL,17,Fextraordinary talent", adding Pattinson
OL,18,F"brings a spirit that is completely
OL,19,Fnew"
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
