OL,3,ALandmark Crimea bridge hit as Russia
OL,4,Areports biggest Ukrainian drone attack
OL,5,Aof war
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia says it has recorded the biggest
OL,8,FUkrainian drone attack since the war
OL,9,Fbegan, in which a landmark bridge
OL,10,Flinking Russia to occupied Crimea
OL,11,Fsustained minor damage and several oil
OL,12,Frefineries were hit.
OL,14,FThe Russian military intercepted and
OL,15,Fdestroyed 2,049 drones and four
OL,16,FFlamingo long-distance missiles over 24
OL,17,Fhours, officials said. Around 600 flew
OL,18,Ftowards the capital alone, Moscow Mayor
OL,19,FSergey Sobyanin added.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
